stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 740 Td (Internship Guidelines for Undergraduate Students) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 724 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 708 Td (A student may register for the internship course after completing 90 credit hours.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 692 Td (The internship must last at least eight weeks and must be completed in a single organisation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 676 Td (The student must find a workplace supervisor who will sign the weekly attendance sheet.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 660 Td (The department assigns a faculty supervisor to every internship within one week of registration.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 644 Td (Students working in a family business are not allowed to use it for the internship course.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 628 Td (The internship is graded as Pass or Fail and does not change the CGPA of the student.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
