<< /Length 680 >>
stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 740 Td (Internship Report and Assessment) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 724 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 708 Td (At the end of the internship the student submits a report of at least twenty pages.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 692 Td (The report must describe the tasks performed, the skills learned and the supervisor feedback.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 676 Td (The faculty supervisor evaluates the report and conducts a viva of fifteen minutes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 660 Td (A student who fails the internship may repeat it only in the next semester.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 644 Td (The workplace supervisor submits a confidential evaluation form directly to the department.) Tj ET
endstream
